       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYVAL.
       AUTHOR. DEMO-POC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY PAYREC.
       COPY STATUS.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-VALIDATION-RESULT         PIC X(01).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-VALIDATION-RESULT.
       VALIDATE-PAYMENT.
           MOVE 'Y' TO LK-VALIDATION-RESULT
           IF PAY-AMOUNT <= ZERO
               MOVE STATUS-REJECTED TO PAY-STATUS
               MOVE REASON-INVALID-AMOUNT TO PAY-REASON-CODE
               MOVE 'N' TO LK-VALIDATION-RESULT
           END-IF
           IF PAY-CURRENCY NOT = 'BRL' AND PAY-CURRENCY NOT = 'USD'
               MOVE STATUS-REJECTED TO PAY-STATUS
               MOVE REASON-UNSUPPORTED-CURRENCY TO PAY-REASON-CODE
               MOVE 'N' TO LK-VALIDATION-RESULT
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
